# graphify - machine-specific sidecars (absolute paths / local cache)
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/.vocab.txt

# graphify - regenerable output. GRAPH_REPORT.md (the written findings) and
# graph.json (the fixture tools/graph_audit.py reads) stay tracked; these two
# do not. graph.html is a 740 KB rendering of graph.json, and manifest.json is
# the incremental-rebuild index, keyed on float mtimes that differ on every
# machine — so it produced a large diff on every rebuild while meaning nothing.
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/manifest.json

# desk agent: raw per-run stdout. Noise, and it can contain chart detail.
# runs.jsonl (the structured record) and out/ (gameplans, Pine reports) stay
# tracked -- they are the agent's memory and its deliverables.
tools/desk_agent/logs/
